Open app -> Has session
Has session -> Home, Sign in form
Sign in form -> Check password
Check password -> Wrong password, Needs second factor, Issue session
Wrong password -> Too many tries
Too many tries -> Lock account, Sign in form
Needs second factor -> Send code
Send code -> Enter code
Enter code -> Code expired, Issue session
Code expired -> Send code
Issue session -> Home
Lock account -> Email owner
Sign in form -> Reset password
Reset password -> Email owner
Email owner -> Sign in form
